Description: Based on “Federated Causal Inference: Multi-Studies ATE Estimation Beyond Meta-Analysis” (R. Khellaf, A. Bellet, and J. Josse, 2025), this package implements a DATASHIELD aggregate server-side function that computes the local average treatment effect (ATE) using regression coefficients provided by the analyst (client).
